Hi all,
Sorry for the late reply, from our perspective, this issue can be considered as closed.
> when were the tests done, can you provide timestamps? Are there Session logs for the Testsessions? The Charger NederlandHeerhugowaard Elektropartners pa Intratuin has according to the Delivery Paper no DC Meter so you only get estimated/Calculated  Values so what was the discrepancy of the Value from the ELM and The charger?
Timestamps were provided in the original report:
